#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:355
msgid ""
"**Still on** ``import sensor``? It works, with a warning. Move to :mod:`csi`"
" (:ref:`v5.0.0 migration <v5_0_0_s1>`); replace ``disable_delays`` / "
"``disable_full_flush`` with the ``csi.CSI()`` constructor arguments and drop"
" ``get_fb`` / auto-rotation calls."
msgstr ""
"**ما زلت تستخدم** ``import sensor``\\ ؟ يعمل، مع تحذير. انتقل إلى :mod:`csi`"
" (\\ :ref:`ترحيل v5.0.0 <v5_0_0_s1>`\\ )؛ استبدل ``disable_delays`` / "
"``disable_full_flush`` بوسائط مُنشئ ``csi.CSI()`` وأزل استدعاءات ``get_fb`` "
"/ التدوير التلقائي."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:359
